marker/event.\n- `tests/unit/test_max_tokens_model_ceiling_1019.py` — `D:<module>`; per-model output ceiling.\n- `tests/unit/test_mcp_entrypoint_provisioning.py` — `D:{<module>,test_poisoned_store_with_dot_git_but_no_resolvable_head_is_cleared_and_recloned,test_no_pat_skips_the_clone_but_still_converges_the_store,test_a_concurrent_reclone_is_not_interleaved,test_a_peer_finishing_the_clone_while_we_wait_skips_the_redundant_reclone,test_the_ensure_step_does_not_run_while_a_peer_holds_the_store_lock,test_the_code_root_is_provisioned_so_attested_gates_can_resolve_main,test_a_failing_code_clone_surfaces_but_does_not_stop_the_container_booting,test_an_absent_code_mount_point_is_announced_and_skipped_not_failed,test_the_code_root_is_provisioned_even_without_a_tickets_pat}`; `C:<module>:before:_FLOCK_SHIM`; portable flock, poison recovery, serialized soft provisioning.\n- `tests/unit/test_mcp_gate_async.py` — `C:test_verify_completion_status_populates_verified_at_sha:before:signature-read`; `C:test_verify_completion_status_reports_stale_for_a_reopened_attestation:before:signature-read`; `C:test_verify_completion_start_preserves_graph_tristate_and_variant_key:before:llm-import`; `C:test_follower_start_does_not_reclobber_the_leaders_index_record:before:mcp-import`; `C:test_follower_poll_before_leader_index_write_reports_attaching:before:registry-reset`; `C:test_gate_status_includes_durable_unknown_when_the_durable_read_raises:before:boom`; SHA/staleness/graph/follower/durable states.\n- `tests/unit/test_mcp_gate_unreadable_config_errors_8408.py` — `D:<module>`; unreadable config errors.\n- `tests/unit/test_mcp_health_startup_handshake.py` — `D:{<module>,test_run_http_with_grace_hands_uvicorn_an_app_that_runs_the_handshake}`; served-request handshake/lifespan wiring.\n- `tests/unit/test_mcp_health_store_status.py` — `D:{<module>,test_autodeploy_gate_names_the_storeless_refusal,test_boot_sweep_warns_naming_the_path_when_the_store_is_absent,test_a_removed_load_bearing_input_fails_hard_instead_of_being_reported}`; store states/refusal/warning/tombstone.\n- `tests/unit/test_mcp_inflight.py` — `D:<module>`; billable singleflight/cleanup.\n- `tests/unit/test_mcp_llm_dedup.py` — `D:<module>`; `C:test_two_concurrent_calls_invoke_the_gate_exactly_once:before:follower_attached`; one leader + deterministic follower.\n- `tests/unit/test_mcp_on_box_infra.py` — `D:{test_mcp_bluegreen_refreshes_ssm_secrets_before_starting_the_new_container,test_mcp_entrypoint_is_a_real_file_installed_onto_path,test_mcp_entrypoint_does_not_block_boot_on_the_tickets_clone,test_compose_mcp_sets_both_bedrock_region_vars,test_nginx_serves_the_documented_mcp_slash_url_without_redirecting,test_nginx_upgrades_any_plaintext_location_from_the_mcp_upstream,_render_nginx,test_nginx_routes_the_advertised_resource_metadata_url_to_the_mcp_app,test_nginx_metadata_route_does_not_shadow_the_acme_challenge,test_nginx_template_substitutes_cleanly_under_envsubst,test_nginx_asserts_hsts_on_every_tls_response,test_compose_mcp_trusts_the_edge_forwarded_proto,_location_body,test_nginx_upgrades_any_plaintext_location_on_the_sibling_surfaces,test_nginx_sibling_surfaces_restate_the_default_proxy_redirect,test_nginx_gerrit_location_still_has_no_rewrite_and_no_proxy_pass_path,test_compose_sibling_services_trust_the_edge_forwarded_proto,test_nginx_review_location_restores_the_review_prefix_on_absolute_redirects,test_nginx_review_prefix_restore_coexists_with_a61d_rules_default_first,test_nginx_review_request_path_stays_prefix_stripping,test_review_bot_redirect_surface_is_same_app_only}`; `C:<module>:before:{_MCP_TICKETS_DIR,_JIRA_PLAIN_LEAVES,_server_443_block,_ADVERTISED_METADATA_PATH:routing,_SIBLING_SURFACES,_REVIEW_BOT_DIR}`; `C:test_compose_mcp_trusts_the_edge_forwarded_proto:before:allow-ips-assert`; secret order, soft provisioning, Jira/provider/region, TLS redirects/metadata/ACME/HSTS.\n- `tests/unit/test_mcp_opcert_signing_goose.py` — `D:<module>`; on-box key/trust binding.\n\n## Protected material / consumers\nExcluded in test_mcp_on_box_infra.py as concise/load-bearing (word counts): C:test_mcp_entrypoint_is_a_real_file_installed_onto_path:before:build-context-assert(12), C:<module>:before:_MCP_REGION_VARS:heading(4), C:<module>:before:_MCP_REGION_VARS:region-fact(18), D:_server_443_block(8), C:test_nginx_serves_the_documented_mcp_slash_url_without_redirecting:before:proxy-pass-assert(28), C:<module>:before:_ADVERTISED_METADATA_PATH:url(13), C:test_nginx_routes_the_advertised_resource_metadata_url_to_the_mcp_app:before:proxy-pass-assert(21), C:test_nginx_asserts_hsts_on_every_tls_response:before:max-age-assert(11). Preserve all other prose, inline comments, runtime strings, regexes, prompts, assertions, data, and executable AST. The 10 directive lines retain exact text and inline/next-code attachment; shebang count is 0. No selected docstring has a runtime documentation consumer. Pytest collects all 17 surviving modules; comment hygiene scans them.\n\n## Independent receipt\nA non-author posts exactly 67 leaf-linked TSV rows:\n`stable_id<TAB>full_before_SHA:path#ID<TAB>full_final_SHA:path#ID<TAB>contract_or_consumer<TAB>before_words<TAB>after_words<TAB>directives_exact<TAB>semantic_preservation<TAB>bloat_removal<TAB>reviewer_session`.\nEach has `after_words < before_words` and PASS in all 3 verdict columns. Missing/duplicate/extra, author-reviewed, short-SHA, or non-PASS rows block closure.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Exactly 67 allowlisted blocks are shorter.\n- [ ] Each path contract is retained.\n- [ ] Parent parses with `type_comments=True`.\n- [ ] Final parses with `type_comments=True`.\n- [ ] Only allowed leading docstrings are stripped.\n- [ ] Only `ast.TypeIgnore.lineno` is normalized.\n- [ ] Attribute-free AST dumps match exactly.\n- [ ] Immutable targets equal the leaf parent.\n- [ ] Protected prose matches exactly.\n- [ ] Directives match exactly.\n- [ ] Shebangs match exactly.\n- [ ] Zero-context hunks stay in scope.\n- [ ] `HEAD^..HEAD` equals the 17 impacts.\n- [ ] All 7 persisted DD commands pass.\n- [ ] Receipt reviewer is not the author.\n- [ ] Exactly 67 leaf-linked rows exist.\n- [ ] Every row satisfies the stated TSV contract.\n\n## Verification\nRun all 7 persisted DD commands: immutable-prose-only, exact-leaf-paths, focused-tests, scoped-ruff, comment-hygiene, diff-integrity, repository-gates.\n\nCurrent main deleted `test_mcp_library_parity.py`; its 2 blocks are excluded from the 67-row review.\n\nThe removed MCP Dockerfile test is excluded from this 67-block scope.\n\nScope census correction: the enumerated 17-path allowlist and immutable-prose-only command contain 48 leading docstrings plus 19 comment regions, 67 stable IDs; the former total of 68 was an arithmetic error.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/unit/test_lock_holder_labelling.py","reason":"Condense 1 frozen prose block (111 base words); preserve operation-named holder."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_lock_retry_zebrafish.py","reason":"Condense 1 frozen prose block (139 base words); preserve bounded retry after timeout."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_lock_stale_reclaim.py","reason":"Condense 4 frozen prose blocks (326 base words); preserve errno, canonical identity, stamp conservatism, dual legs."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_lock_timeout_names_holder_7084.py","reason":"Condense 1 frozen prose block (112 base words); preserve holder-named timeout."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_main_health_report.py","reason":"Condense 1 frozen prose block (116 base words); preserve main attribution/report schema."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_make_lint_hygiene_wiring.py","reason":"Condense 1 frozen prose block (83 base words); preserve both lint hygiene gates."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_marker_single_emission_f829.py","reason":"Condense 1 frozen prose block (148 base words); preserve one probe marker/event."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_max_tokens_model_ceiling_1019.py","reason":"Condense 1 frozen prose block (283 